{"video_id":"APh1Vx0oLmQ","title":"Deterministic Infra for Non-Deterministic AI Agents - Nishant Gupta, Meta Superintelligence Labs","conference":"ai-engineer","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":1045,"segments":[{"start":3.84,"duration":3.84,"text":"Hey everyone. My name is Nishant Gupta."},{"start":6.28,"duration":3.72,"text":"I'm a software engineering tech lead at"},{"start":7.68,"duration":4.84,"text":"Meta, working on building the training"},{"start":10.0,"duration":3.88,"text":"and inference infrastructure."},{"start":12.52,"duration":2.68,"text":"And today, we're going to be talking"},{"start":13.88,"duration":3.44,"text":"about building deterministic"},{"start":15.2,"duration":3.8,"text":"infrastructure for non-deterministic AI"},{"start":17.32,"duration":3.28,"text":"agents."},{"start":19.0,"duration":3.4,"text":"So, most of the conversations around AI"},{"start":20.6,"duration":3.88,"text":"over the last few years has been focused"},{"start":22.4,"duration":4.32,"text":"on models. Bigger models, more"},{"start":24.48,"duration":4.16,"text":"parameters, better reasoning."},{"start":26.72,"duration":3.32,"text":"But as organizations move from chatbots"},{"start":28.64,"duration":3.24,"text":"to autonomous agents, a different"},{"start":30.04,"duration":3.8,"text":"problem emerges. The challenge is no"},{"start":31.88,"duration":4.6,"text":"longer in intelligence."},{"start":33.84,"duration":4.16,"text":"The challenge is is reliability."},{"start":36.48,"duration":3.08,"text":"At Meta and across the industry, we are"},{"start":38.0,"duration":2.64,"text":"seeing agents move beyond answering"},{"start":39.56,"duration":3.16,"text":"questions"},{"start":40.64,"duration":4.12,"text":"and beginning to plan, call tool calls,"},{"start":42.72,"duration":3.96,"text":"coordinate workflows, and make decisions"},{"start":44.76,"duration":3.6,"text":"that affect production systems."},{"start":46.68,"duration":3.36,"text":"These systems are fundamentally"},{"start":48.36,"duration":3.88,"text":"probabilistic."},{"start":50.04,"duration":4.24,"text":"Infrastructure is not allowed to be."},{"start":52.24,"duration":4.6,"text":"Today, I want to discuss this topic in"},{"start":54.28,"duration":2.56,"text":"more detail."},{"start":58.2,"duration":4.08,"text":"The modern cloud infrastructure evolved"},{"start":60.0,"duration":3.76,"text":"around a set of assumptions. A request"},{"start":62.28,"duration":3.36,"text":"Most of the requests are short-lived."},{"start":63.76,"duration":2.76,"text":"Services are deterministic, more or"},{"start":65.64,"duration":2.96,"text":"less."},{"start":66.52,"duration":3.44,"text":"Execution paths are known. Failures are"},{"start":68.6,"duration":3.24,"text":"bounded."},{"start":69.96,"duration":4.04,"text":"However, autonomous AI agents violate"},{"start":71.84,"duration":3.96,"text":"nearly every one of those assumptions."},{"start":74.0,"duration":3.4,"text":"They're stateful. They're long-running."},{"start":75.8,"duration":3.68,"text":"They make decisions dynamically. They"},{"start":77.4,"duration":3.6,"text":"may may execute different workflows for"},{"start":79.48,"duration":4.28,"text":"same inputs."},{"start":81.0,"duration":4.32,"text":"This is what I call the great mismatch."},{"start":83.76,"duration":3.16,"text":"We're trying to run autonomous systems"},{"start":85.32,"duration":4.84,"text":"on infrastructure that was designed for"},{"start":86.92,"duration":3.24,"text":"deterministic workflows."},{"start":90.56,"duration":3.76,"text":"This is probably the most important"},{"start":92.04,"duration":4.36,"text":"mindshift. Most AI demos showcase"},{"start":94.32,"duration":3.76,"text":"capability."},{"start":96.4,"duration":3.52,"text":"But can it solve a problem? Can it use a"},{"start":98.08,"duration":4.24,"text":"tool? Can it compete complete a"},{"start":99.92,"duration":3.92,"text":"workflow? Production systems be have a"},{"start":102.32,"duration":3.44,"text":"different objective."},{"start":103.84,"duration":4.28,"text":"Can it do it reliably? Can it do it"},{"start":105.76,"duration":3.4,"text":"10,000 times, 100,000 times, million"},{"start":108.12,"duration":2.48,"text":"times?"},{"start":109.16,"duration":4.0,"text":"Can it recover from failures? Can it"},{"start":110.6,"duration":4.0,"text":"operate safely? Can it do it in an at an"},{"start":113.16,"duration":4.4,"text":"acceptable cost with an acceptable"},{"start":114.6,"duration":4.44,"text":"latency? With an acceptable outcome?"},{"start":117.56,"duration":3.32,"text":"The majority of the engineering effort"},{"start":119.04,"duration":3.32,"text":"moves below the model layer into"},{"start":120.88,"duration":5.32,"text":"orchestration monitoring safety"},{"start":122.36,"duration":3.84,"text":"evaluation, and recovery systems."},{"start":126.28,"duration":3.24,"text":"When people hear AI failures, they"},{"start":127.84,"duration":3.84,"text":"immediately think hallucinations. In"},{"start":129.52,"duration":3.44,"text":"reality In reality, hallucinations are"},{"start":131.68,"duration":2.4,"text":"often the least interesting failure"},{"start":132.96,"duration":2.96,"text":"mode."},{"start":134.08,"duration":3.84,"text":"What we see instead are infrastructure"},{"start":135.92,"duration":3.68,"text":"failures, recursive reasoning loops,"},{"start":137.92,"duration":4.16,"text":"workflow dead locks, retry"},{"start":139.6,"duration":4.04,"text":"amplification, context corruption,"},{"start":142.08,"duration":3.6,"text":"memory poisoning,"},{"start":143.64,"duration":3.84,"text":"cost explosions. The model makes a"},{"start":145.68,"duration":3.6,"text":"mistake, but however, the infrastructure"},{"start":147.48,"duration":4.96,"text":"turns that mistake into an outage."},{"start":149.28,"duration":3.16,"text":"That's the real challenge."},{"start":153.16,"duration":3.28,"text":"So, as this slide shows a pattern that"},{"start":154.92,"duration":4.04,"text":"distributed system engineers will"},{"start":156.44,"duration":4.2,"text":"probably recognize immediately, an agent"},{"start":158.96,"duration":3.04,"text":"calls a tool incorrectly, the tool"},{"start":160.64,"duration":2.48,"text":"returns an error."},{"start":162.0,"duration":3.32,"text":"Instead of recovering, the agent"},{"start":163.12,"duration":4.84,"text":"generates a slightly different, but"},{"start":165.32,"duration":4.96,"text":"still invalid request."},{"start":167.96,"duration":3.8,"text":"The cycle repeats. Each retry consumes"},{"start":170.28,"duration":3.28,"text":"more compute."},{"start":171.76,"duration":4.36,"text":"Reasoning depth increases, GPU"},{"start":173.56,"duration":4.32,"text":"consumption rises, eventually you get"},{"start":176.12,"duration":4.0,"text":"exponential resource growth."},{"start":177.88,"duration":4.84,"text":"What started as a minor API error became"},{"start":180.12,"duration":3.96,"text":"a compute incident. This is why unco-"},{"start":182.72,"duration":5.24,"text":"uncontrolled retries are one of the"},{"start":184.08,"duration":3.88,"text":"biggest risk in agentic systems."},{"start":188.2,"duration":3.2,"text":"This is the architecture principle I"},{"start":189.52,"duration":3.2,"text":"recommend most strongly. Never let the"},{"start":191.4,"duration":2.36,"text":"model directly control production"},{"start":192.72,"duration":3.44,"text":"systems."},{"start":193.76,"duration":4.16,"text":"The model should generate proposals,"},{"start":196.16,"duration":3.6,"text":"infrastructure validates them, policy"},{"start":197.92,"duration":4.08,"text":"engine approves them, execution gateway"},{"start":199.76,"duration":3.72,"text":"enforces them. The model just suggests,"},{"start":202.0,"duration":2.76,"text":"the platform decides."},{"start":203.48,"duration":2.64,"text":"This separation allows us to build"},{"start":204.76,"duration":5.24,"text":"reliable systems even when the"},{"start":206.12,"duration":3.88,"text":"underlying model remains probabilistic."},{"start":210.64,"duration":3.48,"text":"As we know, containers gave rise to"},{"start":212.2,"duration":3.4,"text":"Kubernetes, microservices created"},{"start":214.12,"duration":3.2,"text":"service meshes."},{"start":215.6,"duration":3.24,"text":"AI agents are creating something new, an"},{"start":217.32,"duration":3.4,"text":"agentic control plane."},{"start":218.84,"duration":4.52,"text":"This layer becomes responsible for"},{"start":220.72,"duration":5.64,"text":"scheduling, memory coordination, policy"},{"start":223.36,"duration":4.2,"text":"enforcement evaluation monitoring"},{"start":226.36,"duration":2.6,"text":"workload routing, which is very"},{"start":227.56,"duration":2.76,"text":"important."},{"start":228.96,"duration":3.36,"text":"And think of it as an operating system"},{"start":230.32,"duration":3.08,"text":"for autonomous AI. The organizations"},{"start":232.32,"duration":2.4,"text":"that build this layer will have"},{"start":233.4,"duration":4.08,"text":"significantly more competitive"},{"start":234.72,"duration":2.76,"text":"advantages."},{"start":237.6,"duration":2.84,"text":"So, traditional logs tell us what"},{"start":238.76,"duration":3.48,"text":"happened. Agentic systems require"},{"start":240.44,"duration":4.72,"text":"understanding why it happened. We need"},{"start":242.24,"duration":4.2,"text":"traces to capture planning decisions,"},{"start":245.16,"duration":3.8,"text":"tool calls,"},{"start":246.44,"duration":4.12,"text":"memory lookups, state transitions. When"},{"start":248.96,"duration":3.68,"text":"debugging an autonomous workflow,"},{"start":250.56,"duration":3.48,"text":"understanding the chain of decisions and"},{"start":252.64,"duration":4.16,"text":"reasoning is often more important than"},{"start":254.04,"duration":5.16,"text":"the final output. Observability becomes"},{"start":256.8,"duration":4.16,"text":"multi-dimensional."},{"start":259.2,"duration":4.4,"text":"Without it, production debugging becomes"},{"start":260.96,"duration":3.88,"text":"nearly impossible."},{"start":263.6,"duration":2.64,"text":"So, as you can see, memory is one of the"},{"start":264.84,"duration":3.96,"text":"most underestimated challenges in"},{"start":266.24,"duration":4.4,"text":"agentic architectures. Once multiple"},{"start":268.8,"duration":4.2,"text":"agents share state, familiar distributed"},{"start":270.64,"duration":5.04,"text":"system issues appear. Stale reads,"},{"start":273.0,"duration":5.16,"text":"conflicting updates, context drifts,"},{"start":275.68,"duration":4.64,"text":"inconsistent views. The challenge"},{"start":278.16,"duration":3.12,"text":"becomes even harder when memory itself"},{"start":280.32,"duration":3.32,"text":"may be probabilistic and"},{"start":281.28,"duration":4.0,"text":"retrieval-based. Many multi-agent"},{"start":283.64,"duration":3.04,"text":"failures are actually consistency"},{"start":285.28,"duration":3.96,"text":"failures masquerading as reasoning"},{"start":286.68,"duration":2.56,"text":"failures."},{"start":290.72,"duration":3.2,"text":"So, safety cannot be a single component."},{"start":292.48,"duration":3.36,"text":"It must be layered. Prompt level"},{"start":293.92,"duration":3.8,"text":"controls, tool permissions, policy"},{"start":295.84,"duration":2.96,"text":"validations, human approvals, audit"},{"start":297.72,"duration":2.84,"text":"systems."},{"start":298.8,"duration":3.04,"text":"Each of these layers catches a different"},{"start":300.56,"duration":3.12,"text":"class of failures."},{"start":301.84,"duration":4.12,"text":"Defense in depth is a well-understood"},{"start":303.68,"duration":5.92,"text":"security principle. It applies equally"},{"start":305.96,"duration":5.8,"text":"well to autonomous AI systems."},{"start":309.6,"duration":4.6,"text":"Many people frame human involvement as"},{"start":311.76,"duration":3.64,"text":"temporarily temporary necessity. I don't"},{"start":314.2,"duration":2.88,"text":"think that's correct. The most"},{"start":315.4,"duration":3.36,"text":"successful systems are likely to remain"},{"start":317.08,"duration":3.84,"text":"human supervised."},{"start":318.76,"duration":4.32,"text":"Humans became become exception handlers."},{"start":320.92,"duration":4.28,"text":"They review ambiguous situations. They"},{"start":323.08,"duration":3.92,"text":"handle normal scenarios. They provide"},{"start":325.2,"duration":3.8,"text":"calibration signals."},{"start":327.0,"duration":4.28,"text":"The goal is not to remove humans. The"},{"start":329.0,"duration":5.8,"text":"goal is allocating human attention where"},{"start":331.28,"duration":3.52,"text":"it provides the maximum value."},{"start":336.28,"duration":3.52,"text":"So, one of the biggest infrastructure"},{"start":337.6,"duration":4.28,"text":"shifts is that AI workloads increasingly"},{"start":339.8,"duration":5.2,"text":"resemble cluster scheduling problems."},{"start":341.88,"duration":4.28,"text":"Demand is bursting. Reasoning depth is"},{"start":345.0,"duration":2.92,"text":"and"},{"start":346.16,"duration":4.12,"text":"Workflows may run for minutes instead of"},{"start":347.92,"duration":3.88,"text":"milliseconds. Resource requirements vary"},{"start":350.28,"duration":3.36,"text":"dramatically."},{"start":351.8,"duration":3.76,"text":"As a result, GPU efficiency, workload"},{"start":353.64,"duration":4.28,"text":"placement, elastic capacity management,"},{"start":355.56,"duration":3.68,"text":"and scheduling becomes critical."},{"start":357.92,"duration":2.68,"text":"Inference is no longer just a model"},{"start":359.24,"duration":4.28,"text":"problem. It becomes a resource"},{"start":360.6,"duration":4.6,"text":"orchestration problem."},{"start":363.52,"duration":3.64,"text":"The good news is that many of these"},{"start":365.2,"duration":3.08,"text":"problems are not entirely new."},{"start":367.16,"duration":3.52,"text":"Distributed systems have solved"},{"start":368.28,"duration":4.76,"text":"something similar for decades."},{"start":370.68,"duration":4.16,"text":"Circuit breakers become tool isolation."},{"start":373.04,"duration":4.48,"text":"Rate limits become agent limits. Retries"},{"start":374.84,"duration":4.32,"text":"become control recovery. Resource quotas"},{"start":377.52,"duration":3.64,"text":"become cost governance. Observability"},{"start":379.16,"duration":3.68,"text":"becomes agent tracing."},{"start":381.16,"duration":2.88,"text":"Instead of inventing entirely new"},{"start":382.84,"duration":2.72,"text":"infrastructure, we can adapt to"},{"start":384.04,"duration":3.56,"text":"reliability patterns for autonomous"},{"start":385.56,"duration":3.44,"text":"systems."},{"start":387.6,"duration":3.4,"text":"The industry has gone through several"},{"start":389.0,"duration":3.64,"text":"phases. The initially prompts were the"},{"start":391.0,"duration":3.64,"text":"differentiator. Then the models became"},{"start":392.64,"duration":4.2,"text":"the differentiator. And both are rapid"},{"start":394.64,"duration":3.84,"text":"rapidly commoditizing."},{"start":396.84,"duration":3.8,"text":"The next frontier is infrastructure. The"},{"start":398.48,"duration":3.76,"text":"organization that won't that wins is not"},{"start":400.64,"duration":3.64,"text":"necessarily have the best prompts."},{"start":402.24,"duration":4.0,"text":"They'll have the most reliable systems."},{"start":404.28,"duration":4.44,"text":"The competitive advantage is moving up"},{"start":406.24,"duration":2.48,"text":"the stack."},{"start":408.84,"duration":4.2,"text":"If there's one thing I want you to"},{"start":411.0,"duration":3.4,"text":"remember, it's this."},{"start":413.04,"duration":2.96,"text":"AI agents should be treated as"},{"start":414.4,"duration":3.2,"text":"distributed systems. Models are"},{"start":416.0,"duration":3.24,"text":"stochastic. Infrastructures must be"},{"start":417.6,"duration":2.92,"text":"deterministic."},{"start":419.24,"duration":3.04,"text":"Reliability is increasingly an"},{"start":420.52,"duration":3.56,"text":"infrastructure problem. Observability is"},{"start":422.28,"duration":3.52,"text":"mandatory. Control planes are emerging"},{"start":424.08,"duration":3.88,"text":"as a foundation layer. And ultimately,"},{"start":425.8,"duration":4.2,"text":"the future of the AI AI won't be won by"},{"start":427.96,"duration":4.64,"text":"better prompts. It will be won by better"},{"start":430.0,"duration":2.6,"text":"systems."}]}